1
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:18,420
Aiming for the sunset
floating over the Nakagawa,

2
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:23,560
I kick a pebble and it
flies all the way there.

3
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:29,260
To Kashiwa from PE,
who was always joking around,

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,740
I got laughed at for
staying so full of energy.

5
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:36,140
Where's the good energy?

6
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,680
Wherever I go, there's only winning.

7
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,940
A nightmare:
the same street scenes that never change.

8
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,900
Gentler than before.

9
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:47,020
Because the crows are cawing,

10
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:48,720
the sun has already set.

11
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:51,940
Yakitori, hobari.

12
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,860
Is someone there?

13
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:57,460
Of the pointy hat,

14
00:00:57,460 --> 00:01:02,420
from the waterworks on to Daishaku-den,

15
00:01:02,420 --> 00:01:04,060
the sunset falls.

16
00:01:06,780 --> 00:01:10,060
Tomorrow too, it ends with a drop

17
00:01:10,060 --> 00:01:12,760
Gatsu-shika-shika,
happiness again, they say.

18
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:14,640
I lagged out and only then noticed.

19
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,300
Because I'm such a fool.

20
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,680
Tetsuwan Ryōkaku

21
00:01:41,820 --> 00:01:45,100
What's going on,
gathering everyone like this?

22
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:48,240
Idiots!
Don't yawn, pull yourselves together!

23
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:53,660
I heard the chief's going to announce a new
invention developed at the Katsushika station.

24
00:01:54,560 --> 00:02:00,220
It's an invention, you know! Where's Reiko?
Come to think of it, I haven't seen her.

25
00:02:00,780 --> 00:02:07,960
Don't tell me she's skipping out alone? She's not
like you. There must be some reason she's not here.

26
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:08,880
Honestly,

27
00:02:11,340 --> 00:02:16,360
We're starting! Don't you dare misbehave!
Yes, yes, we understand.

28
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:17,920
Well,

29
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:18,420
Mahan.

30
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,360
The reason I've gathered
you today is none other than

31
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:26,220
the new invention developed
by our Katsushika station,

32
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:28,760
the Super Power Assist Suit,

33
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:31,460
which is being unveiled as Otasuke-kun.

34
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,080
Otasuke-kun?

35
00:02:33,660 --> 00:02:35,820
What a simple name!

36
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:38,980
Speaking of power assist suits,

37
00:02:38,980 --> 00:02:41,180
even people with less strength, like women,

38
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:43,780
can easily move heavy things

39
00:02:43,780 --> 00:02:44,780
with this machine.

40
00:02:45,420 --> 00:02:48,220
When moving a patient from a bed to a wheelchair,
for example,

41
00:02:48,220 --> 00:02:52,340
what used to take two people
can now easily be done by one.

42
00:02:53,220 --> 00:02:56,220
Indeed, this is something
we'll need in the times ahead.

43
00:02:56,800 --> 00:03:02,180
Then, here's Otasuke-kun and the professor who developed it,
Professor Korosuke Esaki, please.

44
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:06,600
Th-this feels like a bad omen...

45
00:03:15,980 --> 00:03:17,260
What's going on?!

46
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:22,560
Ladies and gentlemen!

47
00:03:23,020 --> 00:03:27,560
Welcome to Professor Korosuke
Etoke's Super Illusion!

48
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:35,480
R-Reiko!

49
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,420
So that's why you weren't here!

50
00:03:37,700 --> 00:03:41,360
I was asked to. I thought it was for some kind of model,
but it turned out to be this.

51
00:03:45,140 --> 00:03:47,200
This genius magician is great again!

52
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:50,840
Developed by the official
genius scientist Korosuke Esaki,

53
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:55,660
Reiko, now equipped with the Otasuke-kun,
has become an invincible superwoman!

54
00:03:56,820 --> 00:03:58,640
Faster than a ball when she runs!

55
00:03:59,020 --> 00:04:00,780
Stronger than a machine car in strength!

56
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,720
She can even stand up to tall buildings!

57
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,600
Hey, I've heard that somewhere before.

58
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:11,360
An invention by Esaki sounds suspicious.

59
00:04:13,180 --> 00:04:15,660
Isn't that Gorilla-kun over there?

60
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:21,220
Looks like he doubts the
abilities of this Otasuke-kun.

61
00:04:21,220 --> 00:04:22,220
Very well.

62
00:04:22,220 --> 00:04:24,880
Come up here and let's see how you do.

63
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,360
It's a challenge!

64
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:30,840
Arm wrestling, finger wrestling,
mangle wrestling, anything goes!

65
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:33,160
Alright, this is interesting.

66
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,840
Ryo-tsu, don't go using your
idiot strength and break it!

67
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:39,300
Alright,
let's settle this with arm wrestling!

68
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:41,460
Go easy on me, Ryo-chan.

69
00:04:41,700 --> 00:04:42,706
Now, as you all know,

70
00:04:42,756 --> 00:04:46,377
Ryotsu-Gorilla-kun
versus Super Beauty F-Cup,

71
00:04:46,427 --> 00:04:49,020
Reiko-kun's showdown. Watch closely!

72
00:04:49,220 --> 00:04:53,180
If I win, everyone here is buying me lunch!

73
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:54,640
Hohohoho!

74
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,020
Okay, here we go.

75
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,660
Ready, go!

76
00:04:59,900 --> 00:05:00,520
Rahhh!

77
00:05:03,660 --> 00:05:04,900
What a massive bicep!

78
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:08,020
Is that really you trying, Ryo-chan?

79
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:11,360
Damn it, then I'm going all out!

80
00:05:14,860 --> 00:05:16,280
I'm totally fine.

81
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,920
Well then, I'll put in a little effort.

82
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:31,260
Senpai lost. I can't believe it.

83
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:34,102
She only put in the slightest bit of effort,

84
00:05:34,152 --> 00:05:35,760
are you okay, Ryo-chan?

85
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:40,440
If I weren't me,
my bones would've been smashed to bits!

86
00:05:41,420 --> 00:05:43,480
Still, what incredible power!

87
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:45,740
What do you think, Gorilla-kun?

88
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:48,160
Do you admit Otasuke-kun's abilities?

89
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:52,260
Yeah, I admit it.
That's some incredible strength.

90
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:56,760
In one week, we're set to show
it to the Superintendent-General.

91
00:05:57,200 --> 00:06:00,620
With that much strength,
it must be really useful.

92
00:06:03,900 --> 00:06:05,980
This could make us a fortune!

93
00:06:07,020 --> 00:06:09,720
Ryotsu became the Otasuke-kun monitor?!

94
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:11,420
That's right.

95
00:06:11,420 --> 00:06:14,340
Apparently he pitched
himself to Professor Esaki.

96
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:18,800
He's apparently going to live with
Otasuke-kun strapped on for a whole week.

97
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:22,740
He's not up to some scheme again, is he?

98
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:34,480
Delivery! Ryo-san's Zeni-Gum Moving Service!

99
00:06:35,980 --> 00:06:37,565
The study desk goes in
the upstairs kids' room.

100
00:06:37,615 --> 00:06:40,204
The TV and audio set go in the living room.

101
00:06:40,254 --> 00:06:42,460
The table goes in the dining kitchen, okay?

102
00:06:42,860 --> 00:06:46,080
Yes, understood.
We'll finish in five minutes.

103
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:47,660
Five, five minutes?

104
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,380
But, all by yourself...

105
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:50,340
Leave it to me!

106
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,600
Coming through, move aside!

107
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:56,865
Yoisho, come on, heave-ho,

108
00:06:56,915 --> 00:06:58,840
Dorya, dorya, dorya!

109
00:06:58,840 --> 00:07:02,060
No matter how much we move, it's like
being stuck in an endless pile of stuff.

110
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,780
Hey, boss!

111
00:07:05,380 --> 00:07:05,760
Whoa!

112
00:07:06,180 --> 00:07:08,940
This is in the way,
so I'll lean it here for a while.

113
00:07:08,940 --> 00:07:09,880
Whoa!

114
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:14,720
Heave, ho, heave, ho, heave, ho.

115
00:07:19,920 --> 00:07:23,920
Iwa! Africa Zoo first-class
delivery has arrived!

116
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:29,480
As always,
it's Ryo-san's Zenigame Moving Service.

117
00:07:30,380 --> 00:07:31,720
Coming through, coming through!

118
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:35,620
Leave your moving to
Zenigame Moving Service.

119
00:07:40,180 --> 00:07:43,820
Great, at this rate we'll
become rich in no time!

120
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,900
What? The elevator's out of order?

121
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:58,140
The new place is on the top floor,
the tenth?

122
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,720
Using the stairs is so inefficient.

123
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:03,580
Tomorrow's the unveiling at Police HQ,
after all,

124
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:06,760
and I want to earn as much as I can today.

125
00:08:11,780 --> 00:08:13,700
The distance is about thirty meters.

126
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,380
Then we can manage it.

127
00:08:15,380 --> 00:08:21,560
Alright, let's go!

128
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:23,940
Doryaa!

129
00:08:23,940 --> 00:08:25,680
Yes!

130
00:08:25,680 --> 00:08:33,820
Something smells burnt.

131
00:08:33,820 --> 00:08:34,720
Wai-kaa!

132
00:08:39,180 --> 00:08:40,620
What?

133
00:08:45,360 --> 00:08:47,780
Damn it! I won't let it fall!

134
00:08:58,060 --> 00:08:59,060
Phew, that was close.

135
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:01,280
What on earth happened?

136
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:05,620
Who? Who's there?

137
00:09:08,580 --> 00:09:11,480
Oh no! The control computer broke!

138
00:09:18,620 --> 00:09:20,660
This is bad, I can't handle this.

139
00:09:21,820 --> 00:09:22,680
Damn it, what a mess.

140
00:09:23,180 --> 00:09:25,480
If we say we broke it,
we'll be made to pay for it.

141
00:09:28,620 --> 00:09:31,140
I've got a feeling this
thing cost a fortune.

142
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:35,180
And knowing Esaki,
it won't stop at just paying for the damage.

143
00:09:36,060 --> 00:09:36,940
If it comes to this,

144
00:09:37,380 --> 00:09:38,860
we've got no choice but to cover it up.

145
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,020
Here she comes.

146
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,920
Sorry for the wait, sorry for the wait!

147
00:09:58,700 --> 00:10:00,200
I overslept a little, I'm afraid.

148
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:05,220
Ryotsu, show the director-in-chief
what Otasuke-kun can do right away.

149
00:10:05,220 --> 00:10:06,620
Good luck, Ryo-chan.

150
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:09,120
Ryotsu, put your heart into it, got it?

151
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,600
I know, I know.

152
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,780
You didn't have to come.

153
00:10:12,780 --> 00:10:13,840
Did you say something?

154
00:10:15,300 --> 00:10:18,440
Yes, the battery is charged,
all set, Professor Esaki.

155
00:10:19,820 --> 00:10:27,380
Then, please carry the thing we discussed. All these steel beams,
50 meters over to over there.

156
00:10:27,380 --> 00:10:32,980
The time limit for carrying them is 30 seconds.
Carry them all the way over there in 30 seconds?!

157
00:10:32,980 --> 00:10:38,900
Ready, Gorilla-kun? Ryo-chan's
strength plus Otasuke-kun's strength.

158
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:40,700
With that much strength, this is nothing.

159
00:10:40,700 --> 00:10:42,240
Well then, let's begin.

160
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:44,340
Ready, go!

161
00:10:49,160 --> 00:10:50,880
What a weight!

162
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:57,340
Looks like you just wobbled a bit there.

163
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:01,680
It's just a joke, Gorilla-kun.
Just messing around.

164
00:11:02,180 --> 00:11:03,460
That's right, Gorilla-kun.

165
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:07,460
Even if you try something like this...

166
00:11:08,900 --> 00:11:09,260
Jab!

167
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,000
Stop it!

168
00:11:19,060 --> 00:11:20,880
Doing them one at a time is such a hassle.

169
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,540
Okay! Exactly 30 seconds!

170
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:35,440
Are you tired?

171
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,660
No, no, not at all!

172
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:38,820
Next, the speed test.

173
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:46,640
Even with 10-kilo dumbbells strapped to both hands and feet,
right on schedule.

174
00:11:47,380 --> 00:11:48,460
Wonderful.

175
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:52,360
Alright, Gorilla-kun.

176
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:54,940
Let's add one more dumbbell to each.

177
00:11:58,320 --> 00:12:01,740
With Otasuke-kun's power,
even if we pull this big trailer,

178
00:12:01,740 --> 00:12:04,280
it should still be able to run
100 meters in the 10-second range.

179
00:12:04,980 --> 00:12:05,600
Impossible.

180
00:12:06,660 --> 00:12:08,480
No matter what, I've reached my limit.

181
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:16,980
The chains are still on!

182
00:12:17,060 --> 00:12:18,600
Senpai, you're going too fast!

183
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,300
What are you doing, Ryotsu!

184
00:12:20,780 --> 00:12:23,460
What am I doing?
Well, Otasuke-kun just went on its own!

185
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:27,680
It won't stop! It won't turn!

186
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:32,160
Senpai!

187
00:12:32,340 --> 00:12:32,740
Ryotsu!

188
00:12:36,660 --> 00:12:37,980
Somebody stop it!

189
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:54,180
It won't stop! It won't stop!
It's not stopping!

190
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:59,120
Somebody stop it! Someone, please stop me!

191
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:01,900
Nyaa! This is bad!
At this rate, it's dangerous!

192
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:12,900
It's such a quiet day today, isn't it?

193
00:13:12,900 --> 00:13:15,240
All you can hear is the
chirping of the little birds.

194
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:18,560
It really is, Papa. It's just like music.

195
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:22,180
My daughter seems to be quite the poet.

196
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:24,020
Papa, you're so silly.

197
00:13:24,680 --> 00:13:27,380
Goodness, what's so much fun?

198
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:29,520
Well, well, this little one just now...

199
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,220
That's enough. Let's have some tea.

200
00:13:31,220 --> 00:13:33,860
That's not fair! Snacks without telling me?

201
00:13:33,860 --> 00:13:37,140
Honestly, no matter how old you get,
you're still a child.

202
00:13:45,380 --> 00:13:46,580
That's no good!

203
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:49,500
It's not my fault, seriously.

204
00:13:52,340 --> 00:13:57,120
Senpai is currently heading toward
Nerima at an estimated 60 km/h.

205
00:13:57,120 --> 00:14:00,060
He's moving straight on
from the starting point.

206
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:09,340
What have I done?

207
00:14:09,340 --> 00:14:12,100
I never expected Otasuke-kun
to have a flaw like this.

208
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:14,280
This isn't a flaw.

209
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:17,640
It can work even while it's asleep.

210
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:23,700
Otasuke-kun's learning mode adjusted
to match Gorilla-kun's movement pattern.

211
00:14:25,040 --> 00:14:26,880
I see, so that's what happened.

212
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:29,060
Then, how do we stop it?

213
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:34,360
It won't stop?

214
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:37,600
If it keeps going straight like this,

215
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:41,180
it'll cut right across Route 8.

216
00:14:41,940 --> 00:14:43,880
Beyond that is Meiji-dori, isn't it?

217
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:47,720
Wait, around Meiji-dori, what's there?

218
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:59,020
This is bad! If it keeps going this way,

219
00:14:59,020 --> 00:15:01,560
Ryo-chan is going to crash
right into that gas tank!

220
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:03,900
Just as I thought.

221
00:15:04,280 --> 00:15:06,880
At this rate,
something terrible is going to happen.

222
00:15:09,060 --> 00:15:12,440
We have to find a way to stop
Gorilla-kun's charge somehow.

223
00:15:13,260 --> 00:15:15,360
Isn't there some good way to do it?

224
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:21,140
Alright, let's go with this plan.

225
00:15:21,140 --> 00:15:23,080
What kind of plan is it?

226
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,460
It's called...

227
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:26,340
the Great Pitfall Operation!

228
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:35,920
Good, keep it up, hurry!

229
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:41,620
We're going to dig a huge pitfall
and drop Gorilla-kun right into it.

230
00:15:41,620 --> 00:15:46,160
Since he's wearing Otasuke-kun,
Gorilla-kun can only go straight.

231
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:48,680
With this, success is guaranteed.

232
00:15:51,100 --> 00:15:52,600
Digging the hole is finished.

233
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:55,160
Right, cover it with the sheet!

234
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:06,400
Senpai will arrive at the
site in about three minutes.

235
00:16:12,340 --> 00:16:15,080
Hurry! Hurry!

236
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:21,840
One minute until Senpai arrives.

237
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,980
The pitfall is complete.

238
00:16:23,980 --> 00:16:24,740
Good.

239
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:26,100
Here it comes.

240
00:16:33,420 --> 00:16:35,580
Here it comes! Big trouble!

241
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:57,720
We did it!

242
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,380
It worked!

243
00:17:00,900 --> 00:17:03,420
Just as I calculated.

244
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:10,020
Is that so, Ryo-san?

245
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:12,560
It finally stopped.

246
00:17:15,180 --> 00:17:16,720
Stop it! Stop it!

247
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:22,500
Ow!

248
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:43,940
Yeah!

249
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:51,300
Ryo-chan, you

250
00:17:51,300 --> 00:17:52,620
No.

251
00:17:54,040 --> 00:17:55,960
The Pitfall Grand Operation has failed.

252
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:58,840
Senpai is still heading toward the gas tank.

253
00:18:00,140 --> 00:18:00,500
What?

254
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:05,340
At this rate, the gas tank's going to -

255
00:18:05,340 --> 00:18:06,960
I have to do something!

256
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:07,640
Aaaaaah!

257
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:09,780
Aaaaaah!

258
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:14,240
Aaaaaah!

259
00:18:15,820 --> 00:18:17,920
But my legs won't listen to me either.

260
00:18:18,700 --> 00:18:22,420
Wait, I can still move my head freely!

261
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:24,440
Alright!

262
00:18:25,940 --> 00:18:27,780
I'll stop it myself!

263
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:30,760
Yes!

264
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:37,440
Oh crap!

265
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:47,240
So the centrifugal force
just made it go even faster!

266
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:54,060
There's only about 1 kilometer left now.

267
00:18:56,620 --> 00:19:00,000
Professor Esaki,
don't we have any other options?

268
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:02,580
Not bad, Gorilla-kun.

269
00:19:02,580 --> 00:19:04,580
But this was all part
of the calculation too!

270
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:05,720
Next is...

271
00:19:06,380 --> 00:19:09,020
the One-Shot Blow-Away Grand Operation!

272
00:19:13,220 --> 00:19:15,720
We'll use that steel ball
to blast Gorilla-kun away

273
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:17,300
and change its direction.

274
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:19,620
With this, success is guaranteed!

275
00:19:19,620 --> 00:19:22,080
Hahaha-hahaha!

276
00:19:23,040 --> 00:19:24,460
Preparations complete!

277
00:19:24,700 --> 00:19:25,760
Senpai is coming!

278
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:27,260
Alright! Commence attack!

279
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:29,880
Commence attack!

280
00:19:56,180 --> 00:19:58,780
It worked, it changed direction!

281
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:01,460
Aaaaaaah!

282
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:09,400
The creation was a success, yay!
Wait a moment, please.

283
00:20:10,420 --> 00:20:16,300
This direction is bad, there's a gas station!
What, really, Nakagawa?

284
00:20:17,020 --> 00:20:21,820
Professor Esaki: I think it's
within our calculations. Next...

285
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:25,660
Otasuke-kun Grand Operation to stop
it with a super-powerful electromagnet!

286
00:20:29,800 --> 00:20:35,060
We're going to use the super-powerful electromagnet
to pull Gorilla-kun in and stick him to it.

287
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:37,560
This time, success is guaranteed!

288
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:40,740
We're ready!

289
00:20:41,940 --> 00:20:43,400
Right, start the operation!

290
00:20:43,400 --> 00:20:46,740
Okay, super-powerful electromagnet, ready!

291
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:55,140
Super-powerful electromagnet, switch on!

292
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:11,360
What?

293
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:13,780
What the hell is this?

294
00:21:18,780 --> 00:21:21,340
Yes! Power up even more!

295
00:21:22,560 --> 00:21:23,960
Power up!

296
00:21:24,390 --> 00:21:26,560
Power up!

297
00:21:36,100 --> 00:21:37,240
Aaaaah!

298
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:39,120
Aaaaah!

299
00:21:39,120 --> 00:21:48,440
Sparks are starting to fly! Yes, good!

300
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:51,700
Heh, everything is going exactly as planned.

301
00:22:02,300 --> 00:22:06,400
It's not just Ryo-chan, other cars
are being pulled toward the magnet too!

302
00:22:17,500 --> 00:22:43,460
Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaah!

303
00:22:49,300 --> 00:22:52,480
Slipped on a banana peel!

304
00:22:58,180 --> 00:23:00,200
This was all part of the plan, too.

305
00:23:00,760 --> 00:23:01,860
No way!

306
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:07,120
Senpai!

307
00:23:07,120 --> 00:23:08,240
What should I do?

308
00:23:09,340 --> 00:23:10,960
When is this thing ever going to stop?

309
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:11,700
Somebody stop it!

310
00:23:11,700 --> 00:23:12,720
What about the battery?

311
00:23:13,460 --> 00:23:16,220
Apparently it can run for five
days straight without any problems.

312
00:23:16,220 --> 00:23:19,380
No way, five days like this!

313
00:23:19,660 --> 00:23:20,760
Curse you!

314
00:23:24,120 --> 00:23:24,600
Hey!

315
00:23:26,080 --> 00:23:26,720
Someone!

316
00:23:28,560 --> 00:23:29,880
This won't stop!

317
00:23:29,940 --> 00:23:30,360
Someone!

318
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:31,540
Let's do something!

319
00:23:32,200 --> 00:23:33,720
Shut up!

320
00:23:34,060 --> 00:23:35,260
It won't stop!

321
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:35,500
This!

322
00:23:37,980 --> 00:23:38,460
Hey!

323
00:23:39,220 --> 00:23:40,020
I'm sleepy!

324
00:23:44,660 --> 00:23:48,320
Ten game, ten game, five lines worn thin,
shell gravel water fish

325
00:23:49,280 --> 00:23:53,040
Ten game, ten game, five lines worn thin,
shell gravel water fish

326
00:24:01,060 --> 00:24:04,560
Sandals anytime,
scandals anytime, don't mind them

327
00:24:05,540 --> 00:24:08,520
Playing Kuudel every day

328
00:24:08,520 --> 00:24:09,640
Nah, no way

329
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:13,960
Boredom? I crumpled it into
a reprimand and tossed it away

330
00:24:15,020 --> 00:24:17,440
Naked instincts, bare instincts

331
00:24:17,440 --> 00:24:18,500
Turn into a fool

332
00:24:18,500 --> 00:24:19,420
Become one

333
00:24:19,420 --> 00:24:22,280
Reckless and broke, what's wrong with that?

334
00:24:22,280 --> 00:24:23,300
That's not it

335
00:24:24,160 --> 00:24:28,100
Just doing it my way, doing whatever I want

336
00:24:28,100 --> 00:24:28,860
Amazing

337
00:24:28,860 --> 00:24:32,620
The Chief's thunder, smoke from the head

338
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:35,620
Run away and there's a turtle, Kameari

339
00:24:35,620 --> 00:24:36,120
Kameari

340
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:37,380
Well, isn't that wonderful

341
00:24:38,520 --> 00:24:40,320
In flowery Edo, joito!

342
00:24:40,740 --> 00:24:42,680
Ryozan Daifun, maido!

343
00:24:42,680 --> 00:24:45,240
Kukkiareru!

344
00:24:45,240 --> 00:24:47,320
Hatarakamotte, kyū-baito!

345
00:24:47,320 --> 00:24:49,020
Jugemu, Jugemu!

346
00:24:49,020 --> 00:24:51,320
Here by the water tree, gaidari suigyo!

347
00:24:51,700 --> 00:24:53,680
Suigyo-matsu, gungyo-matsu!

348
00:24:53,680 --> 00:24:54,900
Gūraibatsu, gū!

349
00:24:54,900 --> 00:24:56,400
A place to sleep, a place to live.

350
00:24:56,960 --> 00:24:58,780
Yabura Kōji, Bura Kōji!

351
00:24:58,780 --> 00:25:00,120
Paipo, paipo, paipo!

352
00:25:00,120 --> 00:25:03,080
Shūringan, Shūringan's Kūrintai!

353
00:25:03,080 --> 00:25:04,840
Kūrintai's Ponpoko!

354
00:25:04,840 --> 00:25:06,280
Hero, Ponpoko, and the like.

355
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:21,220
Good work today.

356
00:25:37,280 --> 00:25:39,080
Well, I'm sure in Kameari...

357
00:25:39,080 --> 00:25:44,260
Everyone, come on over to our town!

358
00:25:45,260 --> 00:25:45,900
Thank you.

